  Automatic Validation
  Run trusted checks during patches and after changed turns.

  1. Enabled             Check JSON, TOML, and YAML patches as they are
                         applied, then run applicable bounded Cargo or
                         ShellCheck validation after changed turns, with at
                         most one correction cycle.
› 2. Disabled (current)  Skip built-in patch-time structural checks and end-
                         of-turn Cargo or ShellCheck validation.

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
